OL,3,GNEWSA140 migrants in single dinghy
OL,4,Arescued in English Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 140 migrants in a single dinghy
OL,7,Fhave been rescued in the English
OL,8,FChannel.
OL,10,FThe people on the inflatable vessel,
OL,11,Fwhich launched from the Normandy coast
OL,12,Fon Saturday night, requested help in UK
OL,13,Fwaters and were picked up by two RNLI
OL,14,Fboats, the French coastguard said,
OL,15,Fbefore being taken to shore in the UK.
OL,17,FIt comes days after Prime Minister Andy
OL,18,FBurnham and French President Emmanuel
OL,19,FMacron met to discuss how to "scale up"
OL,20,Fefforts to reduce small boat crossings.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
